and 4.2 seconds, a brilliant and intense white light band sweeps rapidly from the left edge to the right, completely overexposing the scene and masking the product. From 4.2 to 6 seconds, the blinding bright light gradually fades out, revealing the rack in a new side-angle view on a bright white background, now firmly holding a bicycle vertically.\nCamera: Slow push-in.\n\n[Sound]\nQuiet room tone, a swift energetic bright whoosh during the light sweep, and a solid mechanical click at the very end. No dialogue.\n\n[Avoid]\nProduct deformation, structural melting, stretching, bending, extra unrecognizable objects, sudden jump cuts, shaky motion, garbled text, background flickering; product melting or morphing, stretched or bent parts, invented parts, extra objects; added text, subtitles, watermarks (keep the product's original logo unchanged).\n\n\"non_diegetic_music\": N/A", 1344, 768, 5, 1026808458418002, "minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors", "minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors", 8, "minimax_h3_fl2v_lightx2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_resized_avg_rank_24_bf16.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 244, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "link": 245, "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 219, "label": "width", "type": "INT"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 220, "label": "height", "type": "INT"}, {"widget": {"name": "value_1"}, "name": "value_1", "label": "value_1", "type": "FLOAT"}, {"widget": {"name": "noise_seed"}, "name": "noise_seed", "label": "noise_seed", "type": "INT"}, {"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO"}, {"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name",